  patientData: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 0028c045fdcd440d8eef852b96b702cc, type: 2}
  missionSummary: Mira has a chest laceration for guided stabilization practice,
    then a left-leg laceration for independent treatment.
  sceneName: preOpScene
  surgeryMusicResource: Audio/Music/NormalSurgery
  nextMissionId: ch1_intermission_01
  unlockedByDefault: 0
  preOpLines:
  - speaker: Nurse Rina
    text: You've done well on your first operation, but don't rest too easy, a couple
      other adventurers are waiting for treatments as well.
  - speaker: Player
    text: 'Alright, that wasn''t too hard, I think I can handle another patient. '
  - speaker: Nurse Rina
    text: Alright, I'll bring the next patient in.
  - speaker: Jacob
    text: 'I was fighting some dire wolves in the forest and got hurt pretty bad. '
  - speaker: Jacob
    text: 'While leaving I spotted some priests on a pilgramage into the forest so
      I asked them if I could get my wounds treated then and there. I was ignored
      by them while they marched on without a single response. '
  - speaker: Jacob
    text: So I'm here to avoid the church for treatment.
  - speaker: Player
    text: 'Well you''ve come to the right place, we can treat your wounds here. '
  surgeryLines:
  - speaker: Jacob
    text: I'm staying conscious right now with my spite towards the church.
    waitForSpellSelect: 0
    waitForSpellCast: 0
    waitForWoundsCleared: 0
    waitBeforeShowingLine: 0
    transitionToInside: 0
    transitionToPart: 0
    focusSpawnAreaId: 
    activateSpawnAreaId: 
    triggerEmergencyTimeDilation: 0
    triggerEmergencyImpact: 0
    missionCompleteFlag: 0
    requiredSpell: 0
    requiredWoundLocation: 0
    requiredSpawnAreaId: 
  - speaker: Nurse Rina
    text: 'Lacerations do not close with a Fire spell, it requires a Earth spell
      first before a Fire spell.

      Select the Earth spell on the bottom left
      of the screen.'
    waitForSpellSelect: 1
    waitForSpellCast: 0
    waitForWoundsCleared: 0
    waitBeforeShowingLine: 0
    transitionToInside: 0
    transitionToPart: 0
    focusSpawnAreaId: 
    activateSpawnAreaId: 
    triggerEmergencyTimeDilation: 0
    triggerEmergencyImpact: 0
    missionCompleteFlag: 0
    requiredSpell: 3
    requiredWoundLocation: 0
    requiredSpawnAreaId: 
  - speaker: Nurse Rina
    text: Cast the Earth spell on the chest laceration to bind the split edges.
    waitForSpellSelect: 0
    waitForSpellCast: 1
    waitForWoundsCleared: 0
    waitBeforeShowingLine: 0
    transitionToInside: 0
    transitionToPart: 0
    focusSpawnAreaId: 
    activateSpawnAreaId: 
    triggerEmergencyTimeDilation: 0
    triggerEmergencyImpact: 0
    missionCompleteFlag: 0
    requiredSpell: 3
    requiredWoundLocation: 0
    requiredSpawnAreaId: 
  - speaker: Nurse Rina
    text: Good. Now select Fire and cauterise the sealed chest wound.
    waitForSpellSelect: 1
    waitForSpellCast: 0
    waitForWoundsCleared: 0
    waitBeforeShowingLine: 0
    transitionToInside: 0
    transitionToPart: 0
    focusSpawnAreaId: 
    activateSpawnAreaId: 
    triggerEmergencyTimeDilation: 0
    triggerEmergencyImpact: 0
    missionCompleteFlag: 0
    requiredSpell: 5
    requiredWoundLocation: 0
    requiredSpawnAreaId: 
  - speaker: Nurse Rina
    text: There is another laceration in the left leg.
    waitForSpellSelect: 0
    waitForSpellCast: 0
    waitForWoundsCleared: 0
    waitBeforeShowingLine: 0
    transitionToInside: 0
